Hardware certification
----------------------

The Bluetooth radio used by CMK is provided by the Raspberry Pi RM2
module, which carries the following pre-issued radio certifications:

  - FCC (United States)            : FCC ID 2ABCB-RMC2GW4B52
  - CE / RED (European Union)      : declared by Raspberry Pi Ltd.
  - IC / ISED (Canada)             : declared by Raspberry Pi Ltd.

These certifications cover the radio subsystem only. Manufacturers
distributing finished products based on CMK + RM2 are still
responsible for product-level EMC testing, marking, declarations of
conformity and any country-specific obligations of the markets they
target.


